for dissociative adsorption, giving \\(\\theta_H \\propto \\sqrt{P_{H_2}}\\).", "Step 3: Recognize that the surface reaction rate is proportional to \\(\\theta_H\\).", "Step 4: Conclude the overall rate law contains \\(P_{H_2}^{1/2}\\)."]', '\text{Rate}=k\,P_A^{m}\,P_B^{n}', 'chemistry.catalysis.fractional_order', 'JEEMains Class 12', NULL, 'B', 0.87, 'Recall', '2026-05-23 03:15:19', 'v2.1', 'Encoding mojibake healed via Phase 1 recursive CP1252 segment decoder and ftfy', '2026-05-20T12:40:51.776Z', 1);
